Nymphs are an interesting choice for a "permanent" polymorph (fixed
for a few thousand turns via amulet of unchanging): they have normal
base speed, they have normal carrying capacity, and stealing stuff is
always useful. As an added minor bonus, water nymphs can swim; allows
crossing moats, but remember not to carry valuable water-sensitive
stuff; it will probably not allow crossing the plane of water. All
nymphs are a bit limited by their low hitdice (3), though.

